  "prefLabel": "Ph 1302.01 Administer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 1302.01 “Administer” means “administer” as defined in RSA 318:1, I, namely, “an act whereby a single dose of a drug is instilled into the body of, applied to the body of, or otherwise given to a person or animal for immediate consumption or use.”\n\nSource. #9552, eff 9-23-09; ss by #10185, eff 9-18-12; ss by #13558, eff 4-12-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ph100-2600.html"
